    "media:imagetext": "Effective from Jan. 5, 1953\nCONTINENTAL\nAIR LINES\nCOMTINENTAL\nAIR LINES\n1953\nContinental proudly announces addition\nof the new pressurized Super-Convair\n340 to its fleet-continuing its policy\nof 17 years to provide the traveling\npublic with safe, fast, comfortable,\nmodern air transportation.\nAgain this year it will be our\naim to give you the same safe\ndependable and courteous\nservice, in the Continental\nmanner.\nBE THERE\ninstead of en route\nPassengers-Express-Freight—Mail—Parcel Post",
